		(property "Description" "Right-angle 2x15 header on the bottom edge (the slot pinout, docs/hardware/accessory_ports.md). Used: 5 V, GND, CAN, slot ID, I2S rail BCK (15), WS (16) as inputs and RET (18) as a granted output, MCLK (24) only through the unfitted R to RCLK. Not used: MIC (17), 12 V, 3.3 V, WAKE, LAMP, REV, audio bus, AUX"
